This package is a port of the startup banner shipped by pi-claude-code-tui
(https://github.com/Phoobobo/pi-claude-code-tui), Copyright (c) 2026 Phoobobo,
licensed under the MIT License.

Derived material:

- The 22-frame logo animation built from "███" cells, its frame table, the
  cell-coordinate helpers and the per-cell colour rules come from
  extensions/claude-code-startup.ts of pi-claude-code-tui.
- The box layout (border line, boxed rows, two-column body), the sidebar tips
  and the width helpers (center, padRight, headerColumnWidths, formatCwd,
  formatModelLabel, pickSlashCommandTips, collectPiCommandNames) come from
  that project’s extensions/render-utils.ts.

LOON changes: every colour is resolved from the active pi theme through
extensions/lib/palette.ts, so the banner never emits a raw SGR colour code;
the commands are loon:look and loon:default; the working-verb override was
dropped, so the only feature is the startup banner.

The upstream MIT license follows verbatim.

